        "**Keep functions small and single-purpose.** A function that cleans an email shouldn’t also call the CRM and write to a database. Separate fetch, validate, transform and save. The middle parts, with no network or database, are easy to test. A 40-line function mixing HTTP, business rules, database writes and LLM calls is very hard to test.",
